<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.51 pct, 3-mo 21.31 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.51 pct, 3-mo 21.31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) edged up for the one-month maturity and softened for the three-month maturities on Friday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.51 percent, up 0.01 and the three-month rate at 21.31 percent, down 0.01, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
